%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/diff_test.clj:14 (diff-test)
testing: Diff with differences
元の形: diff/diff の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import diff from dw::util::Diff
output application/json
---
diff({"a": 1}, {"a": 2})
%%% output application/json
{
  "matches": false,
  "diffs": [
    {
      "expected": "2",
      "actual": "1",
      "path": "(root).a"
    }
  ]
}
